#: 093a2c4a9ed14d61b1ff91f76bf16abc
msgid "数据解析"
msgstr "Data Parsing"

#: 242cb76beec94c179d07b3c31b6181b8
msgid "计算周期性边界条件下，近邻原子相对于中心原子的偏移向量。"
msgstr "Calculate the offset vector of a neighboring atom relative to the central atom under periodic boundary conditions."

#: 08bd2841132d48fe9b2118c819afe2cc
msgid "在晶体中，一个原子的近邻可能位于相邻的晶胞中。这个函数通过晶格矢量 和周期性偏移镜像（image）来计算这种跨晶胞的实际位移。"
msgstr "In a crystal, the neighbors of an atom may be in adjacent unit cells. This function calculates the actual displacement across unit cells using lattice vectors and the periodic offset (image)."

#: 0e91326590974bc180f988fbc5b7064c 10298c4b230a48d8a1474891194ce316
#: aa6c7483661e47168e444d35f968d032 ac97f8ba03e94e5a8e33563c0e66bc07
msgid "参数"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: 153140f96c4249c984ddb0512b637b73
msgid "形状为 `(3,)` 的整数数组，表示近邻原子所在的晶胞相对于 中心原子所在晶胞的周期性偏移（例如 `[-1, 0, 1]`）。"
msgstr "An integer array of shape `(3,)` representing the periodic offset of the unit cell containing the neighboring atom relative to the unit cell of the central atom (e.g., `[-1, 0, 1]` )."

#: c17faa6223184eb0b68946580d54b817
msgid "形状为 `(3, 3)` 的数组，表示晶胞的三个晶格矢量。"
msgstr "An array of shape `(3, 3)` representing the three lattice vectors of the unit cell."

#: 45ae587973fa4482b460a274969662a5 53e0d38d43a34d229fa030509b809d15
#: 76ab52f610914b6eaa6b1c7d17bca7d6
msgid "返回"
msgstr "Returns"

#: 7cf076ca7c644795af84e81f2b9c475d
msgid "形状为 `(3,)` 的实际偏移向量。"
msgstr "The actual offset vector of shape `(3,)`."

#: 4bd43bcd7c4548d28dc75eac5912391d bf6a970179a64be7902eae5e4fe04748
#: e77e4b2bdf354535817b01a4f1692aae
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr "Return type"

#: f78656e05f90443c93e7e9b6e341f2da
msgid "扫描所有晶体文件，构建原子类型的 one-hot 编码配置。"
msgstr "Scan all crystal files to build a one-hot encoding configuration for atom types."

#: c778797d8f7e4b32b276ee0e45959367
msgid ""
"该函数会遍历指定路径下的所有晶体结构文件，统计出数据集中出现的所有 原子类型（以原子序数 Z 表示），然后为每种原子创建一个 one-hot "
"编码向量。 最终的配置信息将保存为一个 JSON 文件。"
msgstr "This function iterates through all crystal structure files in the specified path, identifies all atom types (represented by atomic number Z) present in the dataset, and then creates a one-hot encoding vector for each atom type. The final configuration is saved as a JSON file."

#: 77dd73b8cbf54d5c9f6cf1981295a6f8
msgid ""
"项目的主配置对象，需要包含以下路径信息：  - `dataset_params.csv_params.crystal_path`: "
"晶体文件所在目录。 - `dataset_params.csv_params.file_type`: 晶体文件类型 ('poscar' 或 "
"'cif')。 - `dataset_params.graph_data_path`: one-hot 配置文件 "
"`config_onehot.json` 的保存路径。"
msgstr "The main configuration object for the project, which must contain the following path information: - `dataset_params.csv_params.crystal_path`: Directory containing crystal files. - `dataset_params.csv_params.file_type`: Crystal file type ('poscar' or 'cif'). - `dataset_params.graph_data_path`: Save path for the one-hot configuration file `config_onehot.json`."

#: 3fc9db2e57674a66a36fb80f4055998c
msgid "项目的主配置对象，需要包含以下路径信息："
msgstr "The main configuration object for the project, which must contain the following path information:"

#: f6bd5636f7b143eabffa2a3d6d00af62
msgid "`dataset_params.csv_params.crystal_path`: 晶体文件所在目录。"
msgstr "`dataset_params.csv_params.crystal_path`: Directory containing crystal files."

#: 4ded27582b4c457ba3268bfd7a7ed437
msgid "`dataset_params.csv_params.file_type`: 晶体文件类型 ('poscar' 或 'cif')。"
msgstr "`dataset_params.csv_params.file_type`: Crystal file type ('poscar' or 'cif')."

#: 6e642b04e03a4ed794c4adc6345094a5
msgid "`dataset_params.graph_data_path`: one-hot 配置文件 `config_onehot.json` 的保存路径。"
msgstr "`dataset_params.graph_data_path`: Save path for the one-hot configuration file `config_onehot.json`."

#: 6c101703b21c4e84a05aa67cbd704b3d
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"一个包含原子序数列表和对应 one-hot 编码矩阵的字典。 例如： `{'atomic_numbers': [1, 6, 8], "
"'node_vectors': [[1,0,0], [0,1,0], [0,0,1]]}`"
msgstr "A dictionary containing a list of atomic numbers and the corresponding one-hot encoding matrix. For example: `{'atomic_numbers': [1, 6, 8], 'node_vectors': [[1,0,0], [0,1,0], [0,0,1]]}`"

#: 71b0ceea6539448f862581a2a69785c4
msgid "根据 one-hot 配置文件为晶体中的每个原子生成初始特征向量。"
msgstr "Generate initial feature vectors for each atom in the crystal based on the one-hot configuration file."

#: c4fdb77acdcc48b292e8aeedc76c923e
msgid "由 `build_config` 生成的 one-hot 配置字典，包含 'atomic_numbers' 和 'node_vectors'。"
msgstr "The one-hot configuration dictionary generated by `build_config`, containing 'atomic_numbers' and 'node_vectors'."

#: eb62365801eb40aa80d0086bb3bc50b6
msgid "一个 `pymatgen.core.structure.Structure` 对象，代表单个晶体结构。"
msgstr "A `pymatgen.core.structure.Structure` object representing a single crystal structure."

#: 5ab73d840b194baea8ce7a6258b00142
msgid "形状为 `(N, D)` 的数组，其中 N 是晶体中的原子数，D 是 one-hot 向量的维度。 每一行是对应原子的 one-hot 特征。"
msgstr "An array of shape `(N, D)`, where N is the number of atoms in the crystal and D is the dimension of the one-hot vector. Each row is the one-hot feature for the corresponding atom."

#: 9967d0c2b08b435c90673bd4878545c6
msgid "解析所有晶体文件和属性文件，生成并保存图数据。"
msgstr "Parse all crystal and property files to generate and save graph data."

#: 0250265b4765446d87da42e4c36e4ae8
msgid "这是数据预处理的核心函数。它执行以下步骤："
msgstr "This is the core function for data preprocessing. It performs the following steps:"

#: 9a444927cc8a40cc8ea5fad392002409
msgid "确定晶体文件的类型和路径。"
msgstr "Determine the type and path of crystal files."

#: 40ef2196cbbd4df0bbafefc678b65165
msgid "加载或创建原子 one-hot 编码配置。"
msgstr "Load or create the atomic one-hot encoding configuration."

#: 6061c9c9dac64ca28158050e21457959
msgid "从 `id_prop.csv` 文件中读取每个晶体ID及其对应的目标属性。"
msgstr "Read each crystal ID and its corresponding target properties from the `id_prop.csv` file."

#: 2c05c6485fcf4a0d9502e940c3f076ab
msgid "遍历每个晶体ID，执行以下操作："
msgstr "Iterate through each crystal ID and perform the following operations:"

#: 09574d6a25214e978a136c7134f67e23
msgid "读取晶体结构。"
msgstr "Read the crystal structure."

#: 31fb59c34f5e4708b4b1267b4df81127
msgid "生成原子特征（node_attr）。"
msgstr "Generate atom features (node_attr)."

#: 92418b7f92634d47ba548cc7ed33a154
msgid "寻找近邻，构建边列表（edge_index）和周期性偏移（nbr_shift）。"
msgstr "Find neighbors to construct the edge list (edge_index) and periodic shifts (nbr_shift)."

#: 0f1fefe0c05c46bfb77edbc502adfc13
msgid "将所有信息（节点、边、属性等）组装成 `torch_geometric.data.Data` 对象。"
msgstr "Assemble all information (nodes, edges, properties, etc.) into a `torch_geometric.data.Data` object."

#: 543e40ef420c4a48a4d5588f343f3cf0
msgid "将所有图数据存储在一个字典中，并使用 `np.savez` 保存为压缩的 `.npz` 文件。"
msgstr "Store all graph data in a dictionary and save it as a compressed `.npz` file using `np.savez`."

#: 6b80747c12194cbdaf6b0ac75aff3b7e
msgid "项目的主配置对象，提供了所有必需的参数，例如文件路径、截断半径、 最大近邻数以及目标属性的格式等。"
msgstr "The main configuration object for the project, providing all necessary parameters such as file paths, cutoff radius, maximum number of neighbors, and the format of target properties."